
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Online Result | St. Columbus Public School</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Online result showcasing is currently unavailable. Please contact the school office for assistance."
  >

  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #173b63;
      --text: #202938;
      --muted: #697586;
      --background: #f4f6fa;
      --border: #e5e9f0;
      --gold: #d4a84f;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--background);
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      padding: 44px 32px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(23, 59, 99, 0.08);
    }

    .school-mark {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .school-name {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .school-location {
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      margin: 28px 0;
      background: #e9edf3;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: #865f13;
      background: #fff5d9;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.7px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: clamp(27px, 5vw, 35px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #e7ebf2;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f8f9fc;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .notice strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: #0e2b4c;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      color: var(--primary);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      background: #f0f4f9;
    }

    .button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 34px;
      color: #8a94a3;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      body {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 32px 20px;
        border-radius: 16px;
      }

      .school-name {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">


    <div class="school-name">
      St. Columbus Public School
    </div>

    <div class="school-location">
      Ekdara, Jhajha, Bihar
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="status">
      Currently Unavailable
    </div>

    <h1>Online Result Showcasing Is Off</h1>

    <p class="description">
      The online result showcasing facility is currently unavailable.
      We appreciate your patience and understanding.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Need help with your child's result?</strong>
      Please contact the school office for result-related queries
      and further assistance.
    </div>


      <a
        class="button button-secondary"
        href="/"
      >
        Go Back
      </a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Official School Website<br>
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
      St. Columbus Public School, Ekdara
    </footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
